{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Brawnly 是一款專注於肌力訓練的健身 App，適合想按個人目標、經驗、器材與每週 1 至 7 天行程安排訓練的人。它會自動規劃每週計畫與每日課表，讓你清楚知道下一步；<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-157.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>個人化訓練與進度追蹤</h2>\n<p>訓練時可記錄重量、次數與組數，並用休息計時器保持節奏，也可建立可重複使用的自訂課表。動作目錄提供示範圖片、肌群與器材資訊；進度頁面綜合訓練歷史、訓練量、連續紀錄、圖表、個人紀錄與身體測量。核心體驗可離線使用，資料保存在裝置上，並可透過 HealthKit 連接 Apple Health，亦支援公制或英制單位。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-73-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-74-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-173-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-76-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-77-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-78-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Brawnly: Strength Training</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/brawnly-strength-training/id6804473310?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:49:11.040944+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:45:02.455159+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:43.768513+00:00","content_hash":"67da2f04ff17b4ee6c0dbbcdc3a5e4774db33ae4e21f63d9d8ad4cc22c387a1a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}